{
  "title": "删除表单",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n  <h1>删除表单</h1>\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    <ol>\n      <li class=\"Numbered\">从导航窗格中选择<strong>Administration&gt;Forms&gt;Search Forms</strong>。搜索网格将出现。</li>\n      <li class=\"Numbered\">点击<img src=\"/aras-images/searchbutton.jpg\">查看表单列表。</li>\n    </ol>\n    <p class=\"Figure_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/formlist.jpg\"><br>\n      <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n        <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    </p>\n    <ol start=\"3\">\n      <li class=\"Numbered\">右键点击网格中的表单行以查看上下文菜单。</li>\n    </ol>\n    <p class=\"Figure_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/contextmenu1.jpg\"></p>\n    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n      <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n        \n        <ol start=\"4\">\n          <li class=\"Numbered\">点击<b>Delete All Versions</b>。将出现类似以下的对话框：<br>\n            <br>\n            <img src=\"/aras-images/delmess.jpg\"></li>\n        </ol>\n        <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n          <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n            <ol start=\"5\">\n              <li class=\"Numbered\">点击<strong>OK</strong>。</li>\n            </ol>\n            <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n              <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Note\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\n                                 list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n                <p class=\"Note_indented\">注意：如果在弹出窗口之后出现错误消息，表示该条目未被删除。错误消息中会出现对应ItemType（物料类型）的属性名称，格式为[itemtype_name property_name}，该属性必须从ItemType（物料类型）中删除。</p>\n                <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n                  <p class=\"Content_body_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/delerror.jpg\"></p>\n                  <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n                    \n                    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n                      \n\n</div></body></html>",
  "sourceFile": "Deleting_a_Form.htm"
}